SUMMARY:LuxDeluxe
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:The first thing you’ll notice about LuxDexlue is the singer\,
  Ned King. He might be high-kicking\, rolling on the floor\, or squeezed u
 p alongside drummer Jake Edwards with his own set of sticks in hand. Bassi
 st Jacob Rosazza and rhythm guitarist Jake Manzi lean into their mics as N
 ed does\, and 3-part Eagles-esque harmonies roll out. Then the energy shif
 ts to stage left\, where lead guitarist Caleb Rosazza has started soloing\
 , and you know you’re in for a good night.\nhttps://theparlorroom.my.sal
 esforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000CdqCjMAJ\nFrom Pushpin Western
